    ('Explain the rationale for combining evolutionary distinctiveness with global endangerment.',[('R','A distinct species can represent evolutionary history with few close surviving relatives.'),('R','High threat increases the urgency of preventing loss, so considering both factors can prioritize irreplaceable history at risk.')]),
